{"full":"Hello-QM/catgo-LRG","name":"catgo-LRG","description":"AI-driven workbench for computational materials science — interactive 3D structure viewer, natural-language CatBot assistant, visual DAG workflow engine, HPC job submission. Tauri desktop app with SvelteKit frontend and FastAPI Python backend. Drives VASP, ORCA, CP2K, QE, GPAW, DFTB+, SIESTA, LAMMPS.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":207,"forks":26,"created":"2026-04-29T09:20:22Z","updated":"2026-10-15T07:51:24Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["ase","catalysis","computational-chemistry","cp2k","dft","hpc","llm-agent","materials-science","orca","pymatgen","structure-viewer","sveltekit","tauri","threejs","vasp"],"demo":"https://app.catgo-ucsd.org/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T19:54:14.913Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T19:54:14.913Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T19:54:14.913Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:59.611Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:17:51.393Z","stars":205,"forks":26},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:16:46.208Z","stars":205,"forks":26},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:44:28.866Z","stars":205,"forks":26},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:04:14.392Z","stars":205,"forks":26},{"at":"2026-10-11T11:06:07.052Z","stars":205,"forks":26},{"at":"2026-10-15T18:04:59.387Z","stars":207,"forks":26},{"at":"2026-10-17T19:54:14.913Z","stars":207,"forks":26}],"technologies":["Three.js","Svelte"],"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T06:16:12.661Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["简体中文 · Try Online · Download Desktop · Docs & Tutorials","CatGo brings the everyday tools of computational materials science into one workspace: an interactive 3D structure editor, CatBot for natural-language operations, a visual DAG workflow engine, remote-cluster access, job monitoring, and analysis of structures, trajectories, electronic properties, and catalysis results.","It is designed for researchers who currently move between a structure builder, terminal, SSH/SFTP client, scheduler commands, log files, and plotting scripts. CatGo does not replace scientific judgment or provide licensed simulation codes and compute resources; it helps you prepare, inspect, run, and organize work in the environments you already use."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Hello-QM/catgo-LRG/blob/main/readme.md","fingerprint":"cad1ae55b5a43c0ff0087e9bf050602f88cd94eba2992243e9011817f692bb50","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T07:15:18.096Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:59.609Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"简体中文 · Try Online · Download Desktop · Docs & Tutorials","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Hello-QM/catgo-LRG/blob/main/readme.md"},"audience":[{"text":"It is designed for researchers who currently move between a structure builder, terminal, SSH/SFTP client, scheduler commands, log files, and plotting scripts. CatGo does not replace scientific judgment or provide licensed simulation codes and compute resources; it helps you prepare, inspect, run, and organize work in the environments you already use.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Hello-QM/catgo-LRG/blob/main/readme.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"> Direct delivery / 中国大陆直连： dl.catgo-ucsd.org serves the full installers directly through Cloudflare without requiring a GitHub login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Hello-QM/catgo-LRG/blob/main/readme.md"}],"fingerprint":"cad1ae55b5a43c0ff0087e9bf050602f88cd94eba2992243e9011817f692bb50","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Hello-QM/catgo-LRG/blob/main/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:59.609Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T07:51:24Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Hello-QM/catgo-LRG/blob/main/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:59.610Z","hash":"cad1ae55b5a43c0ff0087e9bf050602f88cd94eba2992243e9011817f692bb50","originalBytes":31766,"storedBytes":31766,"truncated":false},"enrich